  "description": "Retry failed operations in .NET MAUI on Android, iOS, Mac Catalyst, and Windows. Enqueue a named operation (telemetry, orders, forms, payments), persist it, and retry with exponential backoff, jitter, network awareness, cancellation, and a dead-letter queue. This is not Plugin.Maui.JobQueue — JobQueue is a typed work queue; RetryQueue is for operations that already failed.",
